            "code": "\tindex\u003d value[\u0027rowIndex\u0027]\n\tdata\u003dvalue[\u0027data\u0027]\n\t\n\t\n\tPackageContent\u003ddata[index][\u0027PackageContents\u0027].keys()[0]\n\tContent\u003ddata[index][\u0027PackageContents\u0027][PackageContent]\n\tEquipemntId\u003ddata[index][\u0027EquipmentPackageID\u0027]\n\tRejectCode\u003ddata[index][\u0027RejectCode\u0027]\n\tQuality\u003d\u0027\u0027\n\tif RejectCode\u003d\u003dNone or RejectCode\u003d\u003d\"\":\n\t\tQuality\u003d1\n\telse:\n\t\tQuality\u003d2\n\t\t\n\tdataDict\u003d{\"EquipmentPackageId\":EquipemntId,\n\t\"PackageContent\":PackageContent,\n\t\"QualityDisposition\":Quality,\n\t\"RejectCode\":RejectCode,\n\t\"Content\":Content}\n\t\t\n\n\treturn dataDict\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\n",
            "type": "script"
          }
        ],
        "type": "expr-struct"
      },
      "persistent": true
    },
    "params.rowIndex": {
      "paramDirection": "input",
      "persistent": true
    }
